[{"answer":"OK, Graham, so let's check we both know what we're supposed to be doing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/1.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/2.mp3"},{"answer":"So, for the university's open day,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/3.mp3"},{"answer":"we have to plan a display on British life and literature in the mid-19th century.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/4.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/5.mp3"},{"answer":"But we'll have some people to help us find the materials and set it up, remember.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/6.mp3"},{"answer":"For the moment, we just need to plan it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/8.mp3"},{"answer":"So have you gathered who's expected to come and see the display?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it for the people studying English, or students from other departments?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not clear about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Nor me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/12.mp3"},{"answer":"That was how it used to be,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/13.mp3"},{"answer":"but it didn't attract many people, so this year it's going to be part of an open day,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/14.mp3"},{"answer":"to raise the university's profile.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/15.mp3"},{"answer":"It'll be publicised in the city, to encourage people to come and find out something of what goes on here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/16.mp3"},{"answer":"And it's included in the information that's sent to people who are considering applying to study here next year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Presumably some current students and lecturers will come?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I would imagine so,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/19.mp3"},{"answer":"but we've been told to concentrate on the other categories of people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/21.mp3"},{"answer":"We don't have to cover the whole range of 19th-century literature, do we?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/22.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it's entirely up to us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I suggest just using Charles Dickens.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/24.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Most people have heard of him, and have probably read some of his novels,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/26.mp3"},{"answer":"or seen films based on them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/27.mp3"},{"answer":"so that's a good lead-in to life in his time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/29.mp3"},{"answer":"And his novels show the awful conditions that most people had to live in, don't they:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/30.mp3"},{"answer":"he wanted to shock people into doing something about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Did he do any campaigning, other than writing?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, he campaigned for education and other social reforms, and gave talks,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/33.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'm inclined to ignore that and focus on the novels.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I agree.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/35.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, so now shall we think about a topic linked to each novel?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. I've printed out a list of Dickens's novels in the order they were published,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/37.mp3"},{"answer":"in the hope you'd agree to focus on him!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/38.mp3"},{"answer":"You're lucky I did agree!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's have a look.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/40.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, the first was The Pickwick Papers, published in 1836.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/41.mp3"},{"answer":"It was very successful when it came out, wasn't it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and was adapted for the theatre straight away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/43.mp3"},{"answer":"There's an interesting point, though,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/44.mp3"},{"answer":"that there's a character who keeps falling asleep,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/45.mp3"},{"answer":"and that medical condition was named after the book - Pickwickian Syndrome.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/46.mp3"},{"answer":"So why don't we use that as the topic,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and include some quotations from the novel?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, Next is Oliver Twist.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/49.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a lot in the novel about poverty.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/50.mp3"},{"answer":"But maybe something less obvious...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Well Oliver is taught how to steal, isn't he?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/52.mp3"},{"answer":"We could use that to illustrate the fact that very few children went to school,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/53.mp3"},{"answer":"particularly not poor children, so they learnt in other ways.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/55.mp3"},{"answer":"What's next?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe Nicholas Nickleby.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually he taught in a really cruel school, didn't he?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/58.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/59.mp3"},{"answer":"But there's also the company of touring actors that Nicholas joins.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/60.mp3"},{"answer":"We could do something on theatres and other amusements of the time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/61.mp3"},{"answer":"We don't want only the bad things, do we?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/62.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/63.mp3"},{"answer":"What about Martin Chuzzlewit?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/64.mp3"},{"answer":"He goes to the USA, doesn't he?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and Dickens himself had been there a year before,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/66.mp3"},{"answer":"and drew on his experience there in the novel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/67.mp3"},{"answer":"I wonder, though...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/68.mp3"},{"answer":"The main theme is selfishness,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/69.mp3"},{"answer":"so we could do something on social justice?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... No, too general, let's keep to your idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/71.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it would work well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/72.mp3"},{"answer":"He wrote Bleak House next - that's my favourite of his novels.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/73.mp3"},{"answer":"It's mine too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/74.mp3"},{"answer":"His satire of the legal system is pretty powerful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/75.mp3"},{"answer":"That's true, but think about Esther, the heroine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/76.mp3"},{"answer":"As a child she lives with someone she doesn't know is her aunt,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/77.mp3"},{"answer":"who treats her very badly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Then she's very happy living with her guardian,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/79.mp3"},{"answer":"and he puts her in charge of the household.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/80.mp3"},{"answer":"And at the end she gets married and her guardian gives her and her husband a house,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/81.mp3"},{"answer":"where of course they're very happy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I like that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/83.mp3"},{"answer":"What shall we take next?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Little Dorrit?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Old Mr Dorrit has been in a debtors' prison for years...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/86.mp3"},{"answer":"So was Dickens's father, wasn't he?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/87.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/88.mp3"},{"answer":"What about focusing on the part when Mr Dorrit inherits a fortune,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/89.mp3"},{"answer":"and he starts pretending he's always been rich?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/91.mp3"},{"answer":"So, next, we need to think about what materials we want to illustrate each issue.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/92.mp3"},{"answer":"That's going to be quite hard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-2-part-3-2023-01-14-19-47-26/93.mp3"}]
